2. Run run_umap which uses the X_pca_pearson.csv output from step 1, and adds "cluster" column to obs
3. After step 2, we have adata with "cluster" column in obs
4. Run extract_cluster_labels to get the prompt to send to chatgpt
5. Use chatgpt / gemini in research mode to get cluster labels
